## System Workflow

1. Measure the distance between the ultrasonic sensor and the water surface.
2. Convert the measured distance into water level percentage.
3. Read temperature and humidity from the DHT11 sensor.
4. Display all information on the LCD and OLED.
5. Turn ON the relay when the water level becomes low.
6. Activate the buzzer when the water reaches the critical level.
7. Turn OFF the relay when the tank reaches the desired level.

